# Build context for server/Dockerfile. Scoped to that Dockerfile so the root
# sandbox image's context is unaffected.
#
# Everything is excluded, then only the directories the release assembles from
# are allowed back in. Their build outputs stay excluded: the image compiles
# from source, and a host _build/ or deps/ carries host paths and host-built
# NIFs into the container.

*

!.prototools
!billing
!core
!identity
!pricing
!pricing_native
!server
!timeline
!timeline_facade

**/_build
**/deps
**/build
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.elixir_ls
**/erl_crash.dump
**/priv/native
server/priv/static
